{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 38, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler to Nippon's shore\nA journey grand a sight to adore\nPrepare thyself for wonders untold\nA tale of Japan in silver and gold.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Embrace**\n\nFrom whence you came a vessel doth arrive\nTo Narita's gates where new dreams thrive\nA swift train ride to Shinjuku's height\nWhere neon glows and shadows take flight.\nFind lodging fit for a weary soul\nAnd dine on ramen to make thee whole.\n\n**Day Two: Ancient Temples and Modern Grace**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a sacred quest\nWhere incense swirls and prayers find rest\nSensoji's gate a vibrant hue\nA bustling market for me and for you.\nThen wander forth to Shibuya's square\nA sea of faces beyond compare.\n\n**Day Three: Culture and Gardens Delight**\n\nExplore the Meiji Shrine serene and vast\nWhere Emperor's spirit forever will last\nThen journey forth to gardens green\nA tranquil haven a peaceful scene.\nImperial Palace grounds a regal sight\nA glimpse of power bathed in sunlight.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Volcanic Beauty**\n\nA mountain trip to Hakone's land\nWhere nature's artistry doth expand\nCruise Lake Ashi with views sublime\nOf Mount Fuji a vision of time.\nHot springs await a soothing balm\nTo ease thy spirit and keep thee calm.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Imperial Charm**\n\nBy train we ride to Kyoto's keep\nWhere ancient traditions softly sleep\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion maze\nA pathway winding through sunlit haze.\nGion district where geishas appear\nA fleeting glimpse banishing all fear.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion's Splendor**\n\nKinkaku-ji a temple of gold\nA shimmering vision to behold\nRyoan-ji's garden a Zen delight\nStone islands floating in pale light.\nNijo Castle a shogun's hold\nStories of power bravely unfold.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji**\n\nTo Nara we journey with joyful pace\nWhere friendly deer roam at a gentle chase\nTodai-ji's Buddha a giant of might\nA spectacle glorious a wondrous sight.\nThen return to Kyoto with heart so full\nA journey complete beyond all rule.\n\n**Day Eight: Departure's Farewell**\n\nFrom Kyoto's shores a final goodbye\nTo Nippon's beauty beneath the sky\nA vessel awaits to carry thee home\nWhere memories linger and dreams freely roam.\nFarewell dear traveler your journey's end\nUntil we meet again my faithful friend.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0021908108610659838}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3947389561508317e-05}, {"token": "▁gentle", "logprob": -0.5696897506713867}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.008129720576107502}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.11255981028079987}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -1.0989763736724854}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.02574259229004383}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "▁shore", "logprob": -0.0605391226708889}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.048890020698308945}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.004354637581855059}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.02191995270550251}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.0143391452729702}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.8194839954376221}, {"token": "▁sight", "logprob": -0.8160218000411987}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0002752163854893297}, {"token": "▁adore", "logprob": -0.25290772318840027}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.17571720480918884}, {"token": "Prepare", "logprob": -0.9767550230026245}, {"token": "▁thys", "logprob": -0.1944391131401062}, {"token": "elf", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0015393561916425824}, {"token": "▁wonders", "logprob": -0.10056326538324356}, {"token": "▁untold", "logprob": -0.0028961640782654285}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.00011324241495458409}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.03918227553367615}, {"token": "▁tale", "logprob": -0.10852634906768799}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -0.009093772619962692}, {"token": "▁Japan", "logprob": -0.11729103326797485}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": 